    "summary": "Call upon the Lord when in distress.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "In my distress I cried unto the Lord, and he heard me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Deliver my soul, O Lord, from lying lips, and from a deceitful tongue.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 53,
            "end": 62,
            "text": "TG Deceit."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 45
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "What shall be given unto thee? or what shall be done unto thee, thou false tongue?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Sharp arrows of the mighty, with coals of juniper.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Woe is me, that I sojourn in Mesech, that I dwell in the tents of Kedar!",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 35,
            "text": "Gen. 10:2; Ezek. 27:13."
          },
          {
            "start": 57,
            "end": 62,
            "text": "Jer. 49:29 (28–29)."
          },
          {
            "start": 66,
            "end": 71,
            "text": "Isa. 60:7."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 37,
            "end": 41
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "My soul hath long dwelt with him that hateth peace.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "I am for peace: but when I speak, they are for war.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 50,
            "text": "TG War."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
